{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-eph-3-1","title":"Ephesians 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The hidden mystery that the Gentiles should be saved was made known to Paul by revelation; 8 and to him was that grace given, that he should preach it. 13 He desires them not to faint for his tribulation; 14 and prays that they may perceive the great love of Christ toward them.</p>\n<p>I. 2Co 10:1; Ga 5:2 the. 4:1; 6:20; Lu 21:12; Ac 21:33; 26:29; 28:17-20; 2Co 11:23; Php 1:7 Php 1:13-16; Col 1:24; 4:3,18; 2Ti 1:8,16; 2:9; Phm 1:1,9; Re 2:10 for. Ga 5:11; Col 1:24; 1Th 2:15,16; 2Ti 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-3-2","title":"Ephesians 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>ye. 4:21; Ga 1:13; Col 1:4,6; 2Ti 1:11 the dispensation. 8; 4:7; Ac 9:15; 13:2,46; 22:21; 26:17,18; Ro 1:5; 11:13; 12:3 Ro 15:15,16; 1Co 4:1; 9:17-22; Ga 1:15,16; 2:8,9; Col 1:25-27 1Ti 1:11; 2:7; 2Ti 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-3-3","title":"Ephesians 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>by. 1:17; Ac 22:17,21; 23:9; 26:15-19; 1Co 2:9,10; Ga 1:12,16-19 the mystery. 9; Ro 11:25; 16:25; Col 1:26,27 as I. 1:9-11; 2:11-22 afore. or, a little before.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-3-4","title":"Ephesians 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>ye may. Mt 13:11; 1Co 2:6,7; 13:2; 2Co 11:6 the mystery. 1:9; 5:32; 6:19; Lu 2:10,11; 8:10; 1Co 4:1; Col 2:2; 4:3; 1Ti 3:9,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-3-5","title":"Ephesians 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>in other. 9; Mt 13:17; Lu 10:24; Ac 10:28; Ro 16:25; 2Ti 1:10,11; Tit 1:1-3 Heb 11:39,40